: 0.86}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": 1.09, "hit_rate_up": 1.0, "min_pct": 0.68, "max_pct": 2.67}}, "median_path": [0.0, -0.07, 0.38, 0.27, 0.59, 0.51, 0.69, -0.19, -0.32, 0.16, 0.08, 0.06, -0.01, 0.43, 0.23, 0.32, 0.65, 0.61, 0.96]}}}, "built_at": "2026-08-10T09:46:19.319980+00:00"}, "c2cd218e691f": {"label": "dyn_tatatech_ns \u2191", "level": "red", "score": 5.55, "members": ["dyn_tatatech_ns"], "articles": [{"title": "Titan shares: Is the Tata Group stock an attractive buy after Q1FY27 results?", "feed": "Mint Markets", "ts": "2026-08-10T09:32:07+00:00", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/titan-shares-is-the-tata-group-stock-an-attractive-buy-after-q1fy27-results-11786352452848.html", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Shares of Titan, the Tata Group's jewellery-to-eyewear brand, jumped 4% in Monday's trade, 10 August, to reach a fresh all-time high of \u20b95,122 apiece, following the company's upbeat performance in the June quarter.\n\nThe rally has also received support from analysts, who have maintained a positive outlook on the company's growth prospects and raised their earnings estimates.\n\nMotilal Oswal remains constructive on growth in the jewellery industry, particularly among the top players, and believes Titan will remain well-positioned competitively, supported by initiatives such as its exchange programme. Apart from industry formalisation, stability in gold prices could further improve margin visibi", "citation": "Titan shares: Is the Tata Group stock an attractive buy after Q1FY27 results? \u2014 Mint Markets, 2026-08-10. https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/titan-shares-is-the-tata-group-stock-an-attractive-buy-after-q1fy27-results-11786352452848.html"}, {"title": "Tata Technologies among 5 stocks flashing bullish signals. Upside on cards?", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-10T03:41:44+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/tata-technologies-among-5-stocks-flashing-bullish-signals-upside-on-cards/slideshow/133080114.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "On August 7, five Nifty500 stocks that gained more than 4% featured on StockEdge\u2019s \u2018White Marubozu\u2019 bullish scanner, according to its technical scan data.\n\nA White Marubozu is a bullish candlestick pattern in technical analysis, formed when a stock opens at or near its low and closes at or near its high. The pattern appears as a long white or green candle with little to no upper or lower shadow, signalling strong buying pressure throughout the session.\n\nTraders often view the pattern as an indication that buyers remained firmly in control from the opening to the close, potentially signalling further strength.", "citation": "Tata Technologies among 5 stocks flashing bullish signals. Upside on cards? \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-10. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/tata-technologies-among-5-stocks-flashing-bullish-signals-upside-on-cards/slideshow/133080114.cms"}, {"title": "How Rakesh Jhunjhunwala's old Tata bet created Rs 80,000 crore wealth after two years of flat returns", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-10T03:34:57+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/how-rakesh-jhunjhunwalas-old-tata-bet-created-rs-80000-crore-wealth-after-two-years-of-flat-returns/articleshow/133079774.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "In 2026 so far, Titan has experienced a remarkable surge in market value, driven by consistent jewellery demand and the rise of organized players. The company's robust performance can be attributed to the effective strategies employed by Tanishq and CaratLane. Moreover, Titan is expanding beyond jewellery into watches and eyecare. This promising trajectory is further reinforced by strong Q1 earnings, boosting investor confidence significantly.\n\n(What's moving Sensex and Nifty Track latest market news, stock tips, Budget 2025, Share Market on Budget 2025 and expert advice, on ETMarkets. Also, ETMarkets.com is now on Telegram. For fastest news alerts on financial markets, investment strategies", "citation": "How Rakesh Jhunjhunwala's old Tata bet created Rs 80,000 crore wealth after two years of flat returns \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-10. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/how-rakesh-jhunjhunwalas-old-tata-bet-created-rs-80000-crore-wealth-after-two-years-of-flat-returns/articleshow/133079774.cms"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "dyn_tatatech_ns", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 TATATECH.NS", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TATATECH.NS"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"dyn_tatatech_ns": -0.53}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-07-10", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"dyn_tatatech_ns": -0.53}}, {"date": "2025-12-26", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"dyn_tatatech_ns": -0.53}}, {"date": "2025-02-20", "distance": 0.02, "member_z": {"dyn_tatatech_ns": -0.55}}, {"date": "2025-07-29", "distance": 0.02, "member_z": {"dyn_tatatech_ns": -0.55}}, {"date": "2024-11-01", "distance": 0.06, "member_z": {"dyn_tatatech_ns": -0.47}}], "aftermath": {"dyn_tatatech_ns": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": -2.17, "hit_rate_up": 0.4, "min_pct": -4.38, "max_pct": 5.62}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": -6.31, "hit_rate_up": 0.25, "min_pct": -10.25, "max_pct": 0.46}}, "median_path": [0.0, -0.51, -1.47, -1.76, -1.57, -2.17, -3.02, -3.3, -6.4, -6.32, -6.81, -5.75, -6.23, -5.04, -3.48, -2.6]}, "sp500": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": -1.03, "hit_rate_up": 0.2, "min_pct": -4.18, "max_pct": 4.66}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": 0.64, "hit_rate_up": 0.5, "min_pct": -7.23, "max_pct": 5.3}}, "median_path": [0.0, -0.35, -0.49, -1.22, -0.64, -1.12, -0.4, -0.48, -0.12, 0.04, 0.68, 0.49, -0.05, 0.21, 0.15, -1.13]}, "hy_oas": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": 0.74, "hit_rate_up": 0.6, "min_pct": -7.07, "max_pct": 5.64}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": -3.34, "hit_rate_up": 0.25, "min_pct": -6.29, "max_pct": 19.92}}, "median_path": [0.0, 1.05, 1.06, 0.74, 0.74, 1.49, 0.0, 0